### PHASE 22: SINGLE REPUTATION LEDGER & BADGE FARMING

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userToken = Bearer <USER_JWT>
@adminToken = Bearer <ADMIN_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Reconcile Single Reputation Ledger vs Leaderboard & Profile (Super User only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reputation/reconcile
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 2. Reconcile Rejected for Regular Admin (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reputation/reconcile
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 3. Current User Reputation Ledger & Canonical Total
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 4. Leaderboard Reads Directly From Reputation Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaderboard?period=alltime

### 5. Complete Project Under 3 Days Old -> Completes with badgeAwarded=false and badgeReason
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-young/complete
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finalLink": "https://github.com/teamforge/demo-project"
}

### 6. Admin View User Reputation Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/reputation?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
